msgctxt "Application description"
msgid "__MANIFEST_APP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The Dashboard Usage Metrics app provides analytics and tracking "
"capabilities for dashboard usage within a DHIS2 instance. This tool helps "
"organizations monitor and analyze how users interact with their dashboards, "
"enabling better understanding of dashboard utilization patterns."
